Steadily working my way through the cast of characters, I've finally
done my Healer ascension. I'm counting Psmith the chaotic priest who
died to a careless keystroke while engulfed, and Yaman the Elf who died
on the Astral plane while testing whether you can ascend without magic
protection (you can't) as virtual ascensions. (Also the two "invisible"s
in the Elf line show a minor bug in 3.1.3).

Interesting points about the Healer ascension: NONE! This is one dull
character. Doesn't start with any major items/intrinsics that anyone
can't pick up fairly soon, boring quest, fairly useless quest item. I
suggest getting rid of this character altogether and replacing it with
something else. Maybe my Flowerchild suggestion of a little while ago
(whose god likes you to hallucinate) could come in here as the Hippie.

Major hassle was the water plane. My crystal ball was out of charges,
I didn't have the appropriate scrolls either to find the portal or
recharge the ball, and no means of writing them. So Biko had to wander
around aimlessly for a long while. This began to get dangerous as I
